<body>
<div class="page">
<header>
 <div class="header-row"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUSINESS WORLD MODEL / SOURCE PROJECTION</div><h1>PS 业务模型 · 点、边与内部定义</h1><p class="sub">点开一个节点查看属性、规则与来源；点开一条边查看它表达的关联。所有业务定义来自模型源。</p></div><div class="stamp" id="stamp">@@INITIAL_STAMP@@</div></div>
 <div class="counts" id="counts">@@INITIAL_COUNTS@@</div>
</header>
<div class="intro"><span class="badge accent">只读投影</span><p>本页展示模型定义，不包含真实学生记录。节点分类来自元模型，状态节点由对象内联定义展开。修改先进入模型源，再重新生成页面；当前模型保持草案状态。</p></div>
<div class="load-status" id="boot-status" role="status">静态模型数据已显示，交互尚未启动。如果此提示持续显示，当前打开方式可能未执行页面脚本；请确认打开的是 generated/ps-model-explorer.html。</div>
<section aria-label="模型探索">
 <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="模型视图">
  <button role="tab" id="tab-objects" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="graph-panel" data-view="objects">业务对象关系</button>
  <button role="tab" id="tab-explore" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="graph-panel" data-view="explore">命令与规则</button>
  <button role="tab" id="tab-states" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="graph-panel" data-view="states">状态流转</button>
  <button role="tab" id="tab-types" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="graph-panel" data-view="types">元模型类型</button>
 </div>
 <div class="layout">
  <div class="graph-panel" id="graph-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-objects">
   <div class="toolbar">
    <div class="search"><label for="search" class="screen-reader">查找所有模型元素</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="查找节点、规则或属性…" autocomplete="off" aria-controls="search-results"><div id="search-results" class="results" hidden></div></div>
    <label class="view-option" id="type-control" hidden>元素类型 <select id="type-select" aria-label="元模型元素类型"></select></label>
    <label class="view-option" id="lifecycle-control" hidden>所属对象 <select id="lifecycle-select" aria-label="状态所属对象"></select></label>
    <label class="check view-option" id="focus-control"><input type="checkbox" id="focus">仅看直接关联</label>
    <label class="check view-option" id="loops-control" hidden><input type="checkbox" id="loops">原地更新</label>
    <div class="tools"><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="缩小">−</button><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="放大">＋</button><button id="reset" aria-label="居中重置视图">居中</button></div>
   </div>
   <div class="view-intro"><span id="view-description">模型数据来自源文件；交互初始化后可切换视图。</span><span id="view-count" class="mono">@@INITIAL_VIEW_COUNT@@</span></div>
   <div class="canvas" id="canvas"><svg id="graph" viewBox="@@INITIAL_VIEWBOX@@" tabindex="0" aria-label="可交互的模型关系图；可用方向键平移" role="group"><defs><marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--gray-300)"></path></marker><marker id="arrow-active" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--clay-d)"></path></marker></defs><g id="scene">@@INITIAL_GRAPH@@</g></svg><div class="graph-note">拖动画布平移 · 按 Ctrl / ⌘ 滚轮缩放 · Enter 查看节点</div></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="inspector" id="inspector" aria-label="所选元素详情">@@INITIAL_INSPECTOR@@</aside>
 </div>
</section>
<section class="sync">
 <h2>一个修改入口，重新生成展示</h2><hr class="rule">
 <p>业务含义、属性、关系、状态和规则修改 <code>model/</code>；布局与交互修改生成器模板。生成器先校验源文件，再生成本页。<code>--check</code> 检测手改页面或源文件更新后未同步。</p>
 <p><code>python3 tools/generator/render_model.py</code>　 <code>python3 tools/generator/render_model.py --check</code></p>
 <details><summary>当前阶段未决项与生成依据</summary><ul id="pending" class="pending"></ul><pre id="provenance"></pre></details>
</section>
<footer id="footer"></footer>
</div>
<noscript>当前浏览器未执行 JavaScript。上方仍可查看由模型源生成的初始关系图与属性；切换、搜索和点击详情需要浏览器允许页面脚本运行。</noscript>
<script id="boot-guard">
(function () {
  var status = document.getElementById('boot-status');
  function fail(message) {
    status.hidden = false;
    status.setAttribute('data-result', 'error');
    status.textContent = '交互初始化失败：' + message + '。请将这段提示反馈以定位问题。';
  }
  window.__psModelBoot = {
    ready: function () { status.hidden = true; status.setAttribute('data-result', 'ready'); },
    fail: fail
  };
  window.addEventListener('error', function (event) { fail(event.message || '页面脚本发生错误'); });
  window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection', function (event) { fail(String(event.reason || '页面操作未完成')); });
})();
</script>
<script id="model-data" type="application/json">@@MODEL_PAYLOAD@@</script>
<script>
'use strict';
(() => {
const rawModel=document.getElementById('model-data').textContent.trim();
if(rawModel.slice(0,2)==='@@'){
 window.__psModelBoot.fail('当前内容是尚未填入模型数据的内部模板。请打开 generated/ps-model-explorer.html');
 return;
}
const D=JSON.parse(rawModel);
const records=new Map(D.elements.map(e=>[e.id,e]));
const typeDefs=new Map(D.types.map(t=>[t.type,t]));
const metaDefs=new Map(D.types.map(t=>[t.id,t]));
const edgeIndex=new Map(D.edges.map(e=>[e.id,e]));
const svg=document.getElementById('graph'),scene=document.getElementById('scene'),canvas=document.getElementById('canvas');
const inspector=document.getElementById('inspector'),search=document.getElementById('search'),results=document.getElementById('search-results');
const NODE_W=230,NODE_H=76;
const state={view:'objects',selected:D.elements.find(e=>e.type==='object').id,edge:null,type:'object',lifecycle:D.lifecycles[0].object,camera:null,graph:null};
const labels={id:'元素 ID',type:'元素类型',status:'模型状态',owner:'业务负责人',since:'引入版本',context:'所属上下文',basis:'依据状态',aggregate:'所属聚合',root:'聚合根对象',members:'成员对象',invariants:'聚合不变量',extension_points:'扩展点',role:'执行角色',params:'命令参数',allowed_in:'允许的前置状态',transition:'状态转换',emits:'产生事件',execution_level:'执行等级',effects:'业务后置含义',preserves:'必须保持的属性',produced_by:'产生命令',strength:'约束强度',applies_to:'作用对象',condition:'命中条件',bindings:'对象绑定',action:'命中动作',at:'人工介入位置',guidance:'判断指引',commands:'可执行命令',kind:'关系类别',cardinality:'关系基数',semantic:'关系业务含义',from:'源对象',to:'目标对象',scope:'范围说明',description:'业务目标说明',definition:'指标口径',measures:'统计对象',goal:'关联目标',inputs:'统计输入',baseline:'当前基线',target:'目标值',measurement_status:'计量确认情况',on:'触发事件',schedule:'定时触发',target_scope:'目标实例范围',then:'目标命令',deadline:'时限',element:'对应模型元素',impl_kind:'实现类别',location:'实现位置'};
const displayValue={draft:'草案',active:'已生效',deprecated:'已废弃',confirmed_business:'业务含义有确认依据；结构仍为草案',agent_proposal:'首次结构化提案，待评审',normative:'规范性规则',reference:'引用 / 参考性（见字段含义）',association:'只读关联',composition:'聚合内组合',allow:'允许该条件',deny:'拦截',escalate:'转人工判断',flag:'继续并标记复核',human:'人',agent:'业务 AI',pending_business_review:'待业务评审',measured:'已测量'};
function el(tag,cls,text){const e=document.createElement(tag);if(cls)e.className=cls;if(text!==undefined)e.textContent=String(text);return e;}
function se(tag,attrs={}){const e=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg',tag);for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(attrs))e.setAttribute(k,v);return e;}
function title(type){return typeDefs.get(type)?.name||type;}
function sourceLink(source,text){const a=el('a','source-link',text||source);a.href='../'+source.split('/').map(encodeURIComponent).join('/');a.target='_blank';a.rel='noopener';return a;}
function refButton(id,text){const b=el('button','ref',text||records.get(id)?.name||metaDefs.get(id)?.name||id);b.type='button';b.addEventListener('click',()=>selectRecord(id));return b;}
function scalar(v){if(v===null)return '未知 / 尚未填写';if(typeof v==='boolean')return v?'是':'否';return displayValue[v]||String(v);}
function renderValue(v){const container=el('span');if(typeof v==='string'&&records.has(v)){container.append(refButton(v));}
 else if(Array.isArray(v)){if(!v.length)container.textContent='空列表（源中如此定义）';else v.forEach((x,i)=>{if(i)container.append(document.createTextNode('；'));container.append(renderValue(x));});}
 else if(v&&typeof v==='object'){const pre=el('pre','',JSON.stringify(v,null,2));container.append(pre);}
 else container.textContent=scalar(v);return container;}
function property(parent,key,value){const row=el('div','prop');row.append(el('div','prop-label',labels[key]||key));const val=el('div','prop-value');val.append(renderValue(value));row.append(val);parent.append(row);}
function section(parent,name){const s=el('section','detail-section');s.append(el('h3','',name));parent.append(s);return s;}
function raw(parent,value){const details=el('details');details.append(el('summary','','查看原始定义'));details.append(el('pre','',JSON.stringify(value,null,2)));parent.append(details);}
function attributes(parent,attrs,name='内部属性'){const s=section(parent,name+' · '+attrs.length);for(const a of attrs){const row=el('div','attr');row.append(el('strong','',a.name));row.append(el('p','',a.meaning));row.append(el('small','',a.type+' · '+(a.nullable?'可未知':'必填')));if(a.values)row.append(el('p','',a.values.join(' / ')));s.append(row);}}
function conditionText(c){if('literal'in c)return JSON.stringify(c.literal);if(c.concept){const o=records.get(c.concept);const a=o?.attributes?.find(a=>a.name===c.attribute);return (o?.name||c.concept)+' · '+(a?.meaning||c.attribute);}
 if(c.bind){const n=records.get(c.bind.concept)?.name||c.bind.concept;const from=c.bind.via?'沿 '+c.bind.via.map(r=>records.get(r)?.name||r).join(' → '):'命令参数 '+c.bind.param;return (c.op==='exists'?'存在':'每一条')+'「'+n+'」（'+from+'）满足 '+conditionText(c.args[0]);}
 const xs=c.args.map(conditionText);if(c.op==='is_null')return '('+xs[0]+' 为空)';if(c.op==='not')return '非 ('+xs[0]+')';const ops={all:' 且 ',any:' 或 ',eq:' = ',ne:' ≠ ',gt:' > '};return '('+xs.join(ops[c.op]||c.op)+')';}
function inspectRecord(id){const e=records.get(id);if(!e)return;inspector.replaceChildren();const badge=el('button','badge',title(e.type));badge.type='button';badge.setAttribute('aria-label','查看元模型类型：'+title(e.type));badge.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.type=e.type;state.view='types';state.selected='meta:'+e.type;state.edge=null;render(true);inspectMeta(state.selected);});inspector.append(badge);inspector.append(el('h2','',e.name));inspector.append(el('div','element-id',e.id));
 const head=el('div');for(const k of ['status','basis','context','owner','since'])property(head,k,e[k]);inspector.append(head);
 if(e.attributes)attributes(inspector,e.attributes);if(e.payload)attributes(inspector,e.payload,'事件携带数据');
 if(e.condition){const s=section(inspector,'规则判断');s.append(el('div','condition',conditionText(e.condition)));}
 const excluded=new Set(['id','type','name','status','owner','since','context','basis','refs','attributes','payload','condition','lifecycle','_source']);
 const custom=Object.keys(e).filter(k=>!excluded.has(k));if(custom.length){const s=section(inspector,'业务定义');for(const key of custom)property(s,key,e[key]);}
 if(e.lifecycle){const s=section(inspector,'对象状态');const chips=el('div','chips');const map=new Map((e.lifecycle.labels||[]).map(l=>[l.value,l.name]));for(const value of e.lifecycle.states){const b=refButton(e.id,(map.get(value)||value)+(value===e.lifecycle.initial?' · 初始':''));b.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.view='states';state.lifecycle=e.id;state.selected='state:'+e.id+':'+value;state.edge=null;render(true);inspectState(state.selected);});chips.append(b);}s.append(chips);const details=el('details');details.append(el('summary','','合法转换 · '+e.lifecycle.transitions.length));for(const t of e.lifecycle.transitions){const row=el('div','transition-row',(t.from===null?'创建起点':map.get(t.from)||t.from)+' → '+(map.get(t.to)||t.to));row.append(refButton(t.by));details.append(row);}s.append(details);}
 const connected=D.edges.filter(x=>x.source===id||x.target===id);if(connected.length){const s=section(inspector,'直接关联 · '+connected.length);for(const edge of connected){const other=edge.source===id?edge.target:edge.source;const b=el('button','relation-item',(edge.source===id?'→ ':'← ')+edge.label+' · '+(records.get(other)?.name||other));b.append(el('small','',edge.projection==='explicit_relation'?'显式业务关系':'从源字段 '+edge.field+' 展开'));b.addEventListener('click',()=>selectEdge(edge.id));s.append(b);}}
 const source=section(inspector,'源文件与业务依据');source.append(sourceLink(e._source.path,e._source.path+(e._source.line?':'+e._source.line:'')));for(const p of e.refs)source.append(sourceLink(p));raw(inspector,e);inspector.scrollTop=0;
}
function inspectMeta(id){const t=metaDefs.get(id);if(!t)return;inspector.replaceChildren();inspector.append(el('span','badge','元模型类型'));inspector.append(el('h2','',t.name));inspector.append(el('div','element-id',t.type));inspector.append(el('p','','这是模型元素的分类。它规定这类元素需要哪些字段；本页未加入旧框架尚未确认的扩展类型。'));const s=section(inspector,'该类型的字段');for(const [key,spec] of Object.entries(t.schema.properties||{})){const row=el('div','attr');row.append(el('strong','',key));row.append(el('p','',(labels[key]||key)+' · '+((t.schema.required||[]).includes(key)?'必填':'可选')));if(spec.enum)row.append(el('small','',spec.enum.join(' / ')));s.append(row);}const members=D.elements.filter(e=>e.type===t.type);const m=section(inspector,'模型中的此类元素 · '+members.length);members.forEach(e=>{const b=el('button','relation-item',e.name);b.append(el('small','',e.id));b.addEventListener('click',()=>selectRecord(e.id));m.append(b);});section(inspector,'来源').append(sourceLink(t.source.path,t.source.path+' #'+t.source.pointer));raw(inspector,t.schema);inspector.scrollTop=0;}
function inspectState(id){const life=D.lifecycles.find(l=>l.nodes.some(n=>n.id===id));const n=life?.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id);if(!n)return;inspector.replaceChildren();inspector.append(el('span','badge','对象内联状态 · 展开视图'));inspector.append(el('h2','',n.name));inspector.append(el('div','element-id',n.value===null?'创建转换的展示起点':n.value));inspector.append(el('p','','此节点由所属对象的 lifecycle 展开，不是新增的顶层模型元素或真实业务记录。'));property(inspector,'所属对象',life.object);property(inspector,'初始状态',n.initial);const s=section(inspector,'进入 / 离开该状态的命令');for(const e of life.edges.filter(e=>e.source===id||e.target===id)){const b=el('button','relation-item',(e.source===id?'离开 / 原地更新：':'进入：')+e.label);b.append(el('small','',e.command));b.addEventListener('click',()=>selectRecord(e.command));s.append(b);}const rec=records.get(life.object);section(inspector,'模型来源').append(sourceLink(rec._source.path,rec._source.path+' · '+life.object+'.lifecycle'));inspector.scrollTop=0;}
function inspectEdge(edge){if(edge.projection==='explicit_relation'){inspectRecord(edge.element_ref);return;}inspector.replaceChildren();inspector.append(el('span','badge','由模型字段展开的边'));inspector.append(el('h2','',edge.label));property(inspector,'源节点',edge.source.startsWith('state:')?stateName(edge.source):edge.source);property(inspector,'目标节点',edge.target.startsWith('state:')?stateName(edge.target):edge.target);if(edge.command)property(inspector,'触发命令',edge.command);else property(inspector,'来源元素',edge.element_ref);property(inspector,'来源字段',edge.field);if(edge.details&&Object.keys(edge.details).length)property(inspector,'字段信息',edge.details);inspector.append(el('p','','此边按源字段确定性展开。要改变其业务含义，先修改来源模型元素，再重新生成页面。'));const ref=records.get(edge.element_ref||edge.object||edge.command);if(ref)section(inspector,'源文件').append(sourceLink(ref._source.path));raw(inspector,edge);inspector.scrollTop=0;}
function stateName(id){return D.lifecycles.flatMap(l=>l.nodes).find(n=>n.id===id)?.name||id;}
function selectRecord(id){state.edge=null;state.selected=id;if(metaDefs.has(id)){state.view='types';state.type=metaDefs.get(id).type;render(true);inspectMeta(id);return;}const e=records.get(id);if(!e)return;if(e.type==='relation'){state.view='objects';state.edge=id;}else if(state.view==='states'||state.view==='types'||(state.view==='objects'&&e.type!=='object'))state.view='explore';render(true);inspectRecord(id);}
function selectEdge(id){let edge=edgeIndex.get(id)||state.graph?.edges.find(e=>e.id===id);if(!edge)return;state.edge=id;if(edge.projection==='explicit_relation')state.selected=edge.element_ref;render(false);inspectEdge(edge);}
function graphData(){let nodes=[],edges=[],groups=[];
 if(state.view==='objects'){
  nodes=D.elements.filter(e=>e.type==='object');edges=D.edges.filter(e=>e.projection==='explicit_relation');
  if(document.getElementById('focus').checked&&records.get(state.selected)?.type==='object'){const ids=new Set([state.selected]);edges.filter(e=>e.source===state.selected||e.target===state.selected).forEach(e=>{ids.add(e.source);ids.add(e.target);});nodes=nodes.filter(n=>ids.has(n.id));edges=edges.filter(e=>ids.has(e.source)&&ids.has(e.target));}
  let aggregates=D.elements.filter(e=>e.type==='aggregate');if(aggregates.length===3)aggregates=[aggregates[1],aggregates[0],aggregates[2]];
  aggregates.forEach((a,col)=>{const members=[a.root,...a.members].filter(id=>nodes.some(n=>n.id===id));if(!members.length)return;groups.push({x:40+col*310,y:25,name:a.name});members.forEach((id,row)=>{const n={...nodes.find(x=>x.id===id),x:160+col*310,y:95+row*112};nodes[nodes.findIndex(x=>x.id===id)]=n;});});
 }else if(state.view==='explore'){
  const selected=records.has(state.selected)?state.selected:D.elements.find(e=>e.type==='command').id;state.selected=selected;
  edges=D.edges.filter(e=>e.source===selected||e.target===selected);const ids=new Set([selected]);edges.forEach(e=>{ids.add(e.source);ids.add(e.target);});
  if(!document.getElementById('focus').checked){nodes=D.elements.filter(e=>e.type!=='relation').map(e=>({...e}));edges=D.edges.filter(e=>nodes.some(n=>n.id===e.source)&&nodes.some(n=>n.id===e.target));const grouped=new Map();for(const n of nodes){if(!grouped.has(n.type))grouped.set(n.type,[]);grouped.get(n.type).push(n);}let col=0;for(const [type,items] of grouped){groups.push({x:40+col*300,y:25,name:title(type)});items.forEach((n,i)=>{n.x=155+col*300;n.y=95+i*106;});col++;}}
  else {nodes=[...ids].map(id=>records.get(id)).filter(Boolean).map(n=>({...n}));const center=nodes.find(n=>n.id===selected);if(center){center.x=570;center.y=440;}const others=nodes.filter(n=>n.id!==selected);const radius=Math.max(300,others.length*45);others.forEach((n,i)=>{const angle=-Math.PI/2+2*Math.PI*i/Math.max(1,others.length);n.x=570+Math.cos(angle)*radius;n.y=440+Math.sin(angle)*radius;});}
 }else if(state.view==='states'){
  const life=D.lifecycles.find(l=>l.object===state.lifecycle)||D.lifecycles[0];state.lifecycle=life.object;nodes=life.nodes.map((n,i)=>({...n,x:150+(i%4)*300,y:110+Math.floor(i/4)*240}));edges=life.edges.filter(e=>document.getElementById('loops').checked||e.source!==e.target);
 }else{
  const type=typeDefs.get(state.type)||D.types[0];state.type=type.type;const members=D.elements.filter(e=>e.type===type.type);nodes=[{id:type.id,name:type.name,type:'meta_projection',x:460,y:100},...members.map((e,i)=>({...e,x:150+(i%3)*310,y:290+Math.floor(i/3)*116}))];edges=members.map(e=>({id:'classification:'+e.id,source:type.id,target:e.id,label:'元素分类',projection:'meta_classification',element_ref:e.id,field:'type',details:{type:e.type}}));
 }
 return {nodes,edges,groups};}
function nodeNameLines(name,max=12){const chars=[...name];if(chars.length<=max)return [name];return [chars.slice(0,max).join(''),chars.slice(max).join('')];}
function rectPoint(n,dx,dy){const t=1/Math.max(Math.abs(dx)/(NODE_W/2),Math.abs(dy)/(NODE_H/2));return {x:n.x+dx*t,y:n.y+dy*t};}
function isRelated(id){if(id===state.selected)return true;const selectedEdge=state.graph?.edges.find(e=>e.id===state.edge);if(selectedEdge)return selectedEdge.source===id||selectedEdge.target===id;return state.graph?.edges.some(e=>(e.source===state.selected&&e.target===id)||(e.target===state.selected&&e.source===id));}
function draw(){scene.replaceChildren();const G=state.graph;const map=new Map(G.nodes.map(n=>[n.id,n]));
 for(const group of G.groups){const line=se('line',{x1:group.x-20,y1:group.y+18,x2:group.x+250,y2:group.y+18,class:'group-line'});scene.append(line);const label=se('text',{x:group.x,y:group.y,class:'group-label'});label.textContent=group.name;scene.append(label);}
 const pairs=new Map();for(const e of G.edges){const key=[e.source,e.target].sort().join('|');if(!pairs.has(key))pairs.set(key,[]);pairs.get(key).push(e);}
 for(const e of G.edges){const a=map.get(e.source),b=map.get(e.target);if(!a||!b)continue;const active=e.id===state.edge||e.source===state.selected||e.target===state.selected;const g=se('g',{class:'edge'+(active?' active':'')+(state.edge===e.id?' selected':''), 'data-edge-id':e.id,role:'button',tabindex:0,'aria-label':'关系：'+e.label+'；'+a.name+' 到 '+b.name});let path,label;
  if(a.id===b.id){path=`M ${a.x+NODE_W/2-15} ${a.y-20} C ${a.x+230} ${a.y-140},${a.x+230} ${a.y+130},${a.x+NODE_W/2-10} ${a.y+22}`;label={x:a.x+215,y:a.y};}
  else{const dx=b.x-a.x,dy=b.y-a.y,start=rectPoint(a,dx,dy),end=rectPoint(b,-dx,-dy);const list=pairs.get([e.source,e.target].sort().join('|'));const lane=list.indexOf(e)-(list.length-1)/2;const len=Math.hypot(dx,dy)||1;let bend=lane*48;if(state.view==='states'&&a.y===b.y&&Math.abs(dx)>310)bend+=100;const control={x:(start.x+end.x)/2-dy/len*bend,y:(start.y+end.y)/2+dx/len*bend};path=`M ${start.x} ${start.y} Q ${control.x} ${control.y} ${end.x} ${end.y}`;label={x:(start.x+end.x+2*control.x)/4,y:(start.y+end.y+2*control.y)/4};}
  const line=se('path',{d:path,class:'line'}),hit=se('path',{d:path,class:'hit'});g.append(line,hit);const tooltip=se('title');tooltip.textContent=e.label;g.append(tooltip);
  if(active){const words=nodeNameLines(e.label,14),width=Math.max(...words.map(s=>[...s].length))*12+12;g.append(se('rect',{x:label.x-width/2,y:label.y-10,width,height:words.length*15+4,rx:4,class:'edge-label-bg'}));const text=se('text',{x:label.x,y:label.y+2,'text-anchor':'middle'});words.forEach((word,i)=>{const t=se('tspan',{x:label.x,dy:i?15:0});t.textContent=word;text.append(t);});g.append(text);}
  g.addEventListener('click',ev=>{ev.stopPropagation();selectEdge(e.id);});g.addEventListener('keydown',ev=>{if(ev.key==='Enter'||ev.key===' '){ev.preventDefault();selectEdge(e.id);}});scene.append(g);
 }
 for(const n of G.nodes){const selected=n.id===state.selected;const g=se('g',{transform:`translate(${n.x},${n.y})`,class:'node'+(selected?' selected':'')+(!isRelated(n.id)&&state.view!=='types'?' muted':'')+(n.type.endsWith('_projection')?' derived':''),'data-node-id':n.id,role:'button',tabindex:0,'aria-label':(n.type.endsWith('_projection')?'展开节点':title(n.type))+'：'+n.name,'aria-pressed':String(selected)});g.append(se('rect',{x:-NODE_W/2,y:-NODE_H/2,width:NODE_W,height:NODE_H}));const caption=se('text',{x:0,y:-16,'text-anchor':'middle',class:'node-caption'});caption.textContent=n.type==='meta_projection'?'元模型类型':n.type==='state_projection'?'对象状态':n.type==='creation_projection'?'创建转换':title(n.type);g.append(caption);const lines=nodeNameLines(n.name,12);lines.forEach((line,i)=>{const text=se('text',{x:0,y:lines.length===1?14:8+i*22,'text-anchor':'middle',class:'node-name'});text.textContent=line;g.append(text);});const tooltip=se('title');tooltip.textContent=n.name+' · '+n.id;g.append(tooltip);g.addEventListener('click',ev=>{ev.stopPropagation();if(n.type==='meta_projection'){state.selected=n.id;state.edge=null;render(false);inspectMeta(n.id);}else if(n.type==='state_projection'||n.type==='creation_projection'){state.selected=n.id;state.edge=null;render(false);inspectState(n.id);}else{state.selected=n.id;state.edge=null;render(false);inspectRecord(n.id);}});g.addEventListener('keydown',ev=>{if(ev.key==='Enter'||ev.key===' '){ev.preventDefault();g.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click',{bubbles:true}));}});scene.append(g);}
}
function updateCamera(){if(!state.camera)return;const c=state.camera;svg.setAttribute('viewBox',`${c.x} ${c.y} ${c.w} ${c.h}`);}
function resetCamera(){const nodes=state.graph.nodes;if(!nodes.length)return;const r=canvas.getBoundingClientRect();const x1=Math.min(...nodes.map(n=>n.x))-160,x2=Math.max(...nodes.map(n=>n.x))+160,y1=Math.min(...nodes.map(n=>n.y))-75,y2=Math.max(...nodes.map(n=>n.y))+85;const ratio=r.width/r.height;let w=Math.max(x2-x1,(y2-y1)*ratio),h=w/ratio;const minScale=r.width<600?.82:.72;if(r.width/w<minScale){w=r.width/minScale;h=r.height/minScale;const sel=nodes.find(n=>n.id===state.selected);const cx=sel?.x??(x1+x2)/2,cy=sel?.y??(y1+y2)/2;state.camera={x:cx-w/2,y:cy-h/2,w,h};}else state.camera={x:(x1+x2-w)/2,y:(y1+y2-h)/2,w,h};updateCamera();}
function zoom(factor){if(!state.camera)return;const c=state.camera;const w=Math.max(260,Math.min(6500,c.w*factor)),h=w*canvas.clientHeight/canvas.clientWidth;state.camera={x:c.x+(c.w-w)/2,y:c.y+(c.h-h)/2,w,h};updateCamera();}
function render(reset=false){document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(b.dataset.view===state.view)));document.getElementById('graph-panel').setAttribute('aria-labelledby','tab-'+state.view);document.getElementById('type-control').hidden=state.view!=='types';document.getElementById('lifecycle-control').hidden=state.view!=='states';document.getElementById('loops-control').hidden=state.view!=='states';document.getElementById('focus-control').hidden=!['objects','explore'].includes(state.view);document.getElementById('type-select').value=state.type;document.getElementById('lifecycle-select').value=state.lifecycle;
 const descriptions={objects:'显式业务关系来自 objects.yaml；选中节点高亮直接关联。',explore:'从命令、规则、角色、事件等源字段展开关系；可勾选“仅看直接关联”聚焦。',states:'状态从对象 lifecycle 展开；边上的文字来自触发命令，创建起点是展示节点。',types:'上方是元模型分类，下方是此类模型定义；本页没有具体学生或稿件实例。'};document.getElementById('view-description').textContent=descriptions[state.view];state.graph=graphData();draw();document.getElementById('view-count').textContent=state.graph.nodes.length+' 点 / '+state.graph.edges.length+' 边';if(reset||!state.camera)resetCamera();}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.view=button.dataset.view;state.edge=null;if(state.view==='objects'){state.selected=D.elements.find(e=>e.type==='object').id;document.getElementById('focus').checked=false;}if(state.view==='explore'){state.selected=D.elements.find(e=>e.type==='rule')?.applies_to[0]||D.elements.find(e=>e.type==='command').id;document.getElementById('focus').checked=true;}if(state.view==='states'){state.selected=D.lifecycles.find(l=>l.object===state.lifecycle).nodes.find(n=>n.initial).id;}if(state.view==='types')state.selected='meta:'+state.type;render(true);if(state.view==='types')inspectMeta(state.selected);else if(state.view==='states')inspectState(state.selected);else inspectRecord(state.selected);}));
for(const t of D.types){const o=el('option','',t.name+' · '+D.elements.filter(e=>e.type===t.type).length);o.value=t.type;document.getElementById('type-select').append(o);}
for(const l of D.lifecycles){const o=el('option','',l.name);o.value=l.object;document.getElementById('lifecycle-select').append(o);}
document.getElementById('type-select').addEventListener('change',ev=>{state.type=ev.target.value;state.selected='meta:'+state.type;state.edge=null;render(true);inspectMeta(state.selected);});
document.getElementById('lifecycle-select').addEventListener('change',ev=>{state.lifecycle=ev.target.value;state.selected=D.lifecycles.find(l=>l.object===state.lifecycle).nodes.find(n=>n.initial).id;state.edge=null;render(true);inspectState(state.selected);});
document.getElementById('focus').addEventListener('change',()=>render(true));document.getElementById('loops').addEventListener('change',()=>render(true));
document.getElementById('zoom-in').addEventListener('click',()=>zoom(.8));document.getElementById('zoom-out').addEventListener('click',()=>zoom(1.25));document.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click',resetCamera);
search.addEventListener('input',()=>{const query=search.value.trim().toLowerCase();results.replaceChildren();if(!query){results.hidden=true;return;}const matches=D.elements.filter(e=>(e.name+' '+e.id+' '+JSON.stringify(e.attributes||[])+' '+(e.semantic||'')).toLowerCase().includes(query));for(const e of matches.slice(0,16)){const b=el('button','',e.name);b.append(el('small','',title(e.type)+' · '+e.id));b.addEventListener('click',()=>{selectRecord(e.id);results.hidden=true;search.value='';});results.append(b);}results.append(el('div','search-feedback',matches.length?'找到 '+matches.length+' 个元素'+(matches.length>16?'，请继续输入缩小范围':''):'未找到匹配元素'));results.hidden=false;});
